# Copy to .env.local for secrets. Gitignored — never commit it.
#
# YOU PROBABLY DO NOT NEED THIS FILE YET.
#
# The shared Supabase project URL and anon key are committed in `.env`, so
# cloning the repo and running `npm run dev` connects to the database with no
# setup. This file is only for actual secrets and personal overrides.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Anthropic — document extraction (handoff Step 5)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SERVER ONLY. No NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix, ever — that ships the key to every
# visitor's browser.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-opus-5

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Supabase override (optional)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Only if you want to point at your OWN Supabase project instead of the shared
# one in .env. Values here win. Leave blank to use the team project.
#
# Never put the service_role key in any env file — it bypasses row-level
# security entirely.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
